{
  "name": "Sorcery Incarnate",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>If you have no uses of Innate Sorcery left, you can use it if you spend 2 Sorcery Points when you take the Bonus Action to activate it.</p><p>In addition, while your Innate Sorcery feature is active, you can use up to two of your Metamagic options on each spell you cast.</p><p>Additionally, you add your Charisma modifier to the damage you deal with any Sorcerer cantrip.</p>",
